1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,760
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:05,980
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:08,520
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,150
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

5
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,600
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,570
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

7
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:18,880
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,960
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:25,480
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

10
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:30,530
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,000
Life is SoLight with Solar.
